{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022074206084-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022102003\"/><p>野豬在維園草坪覓食。(張開裕攝)</p><p>銅鑼灣有野豬出沒。今日(22日)早上7時17分，有途人報案指一隻約1米長野豬在熙來攘往的興發街徘徊。人員接報到場手持長盾牌戒備，並尾隨監察野豬去向，期間野豬步進維園內一草坪上繼續覓食，警員站在草坪外圍未有行動，以免野豬受驚亂竄釀成意外。待漁護署人員到場協助處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:02:41.525131+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:42:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:13.339166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:13.339166+00:00","content_hash":"a5dc10a4ce26d37f042340836bc22a22e4fe1964d73c259f6cc273a00a208146","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}